/T (EfficientNet-B0 CNN architecture implemented from scratch. The current stage focused on building a standalone Vision Transformer \(ViT-Small\) from scratch, verifying its main components, and completing an eight-epoch training run. The implementation includes patch embedding, positional embeddings, transformer encoder blocks with multi-head self-attention and feed-forward layers, and a four-class classification head.)
/E (EfficientNet-B0 CNN architecture implemented from scratch. The current stage focused on building a standalone Vision Transformer \(ViT-Small\) from scratch, verifying its main components, and completing an eight-epoch training run. The implementation includes patch embedding, positional embeddings, transformer encoder blocks with multi-head self-attention and feed-forward layers, and a four-class classification head.)
