/Title (The best observed test accuracy was 78.50% at Epoch 3; the final Epoch 8 test accuracy was 78.00%. The result is recorded as a baseline for the next stage. The original research paper uses ImageNet-pretrained EfficientNet-B0 and ViT-Small, while our project intentionally trains both architectures from scratch. Consequently, the paper's)
